  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 cup milk",
    "2 large eggs",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 cup water",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "0.5 cup vegetable oil",
    "0.5 cup peanut butter",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "0.5 cup peanut butter",
    "0.33333334326744 cup milk",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "4.75 cups confectioners' sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bGSnPfMwFeXVROu9QwM_D9DzCtw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235746-Peanut-Butter-Cake-ddmfs-step-01-4x3_8691-92aca8dd75cd46f08253465ebcbacd34.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235746/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a rimmed 10x15-inch baking pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the cake: Whisk together flour, sugar, and baking soda in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/szroaOLeFgnE294Pbi2082X06UI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235746-Peanut-Butter-Cake-ddmfs-step-02-4x3_8693-a9e22d60386d4f3796993562c906e14d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235746/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat milk, eggs, and vanilla into flour mixture with an electric mixer on low speed until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DmNOCINqtK7Xa6eG0jNG7E6Sdv8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235746-Peanut-Butter-Cake-ddmfs-step-03.1-4x3_8697-2410b57457f947729f414fccb4b3db60.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235746/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place water, butter, oil, and peanut butter into a saucepan; cook and stir over medium heat until smooth, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/V0gFCUfBirWmeqO_wX1nSD2b7j0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235746-Peanut-Butter-Cake-ddmfs-step-04-4x3_8701-71f12021ae6140c2995152fe38bc6b94.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235746/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir peanut butter mixture into flour mixture until batter is well mixed; pour and spread onto the prepared baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eiohfPwOUHOMI1hOJhkzalU6W9I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235746-Peanut-Butter-Cake-ddmfs-step-06-4x3_8703-d8ffa5e20451488192013a956fdaae4f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235746/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center of the cake comes out clean, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the icing: Melt butter and peanut butter in a saucepan over medium heat; stir until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4RHZQQZoUZjYkSDD-qN5d2uW01g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235746-Peanut-Butter-Cake-ddmfs-step-07-4x3_8706-77d97aae613b4f8789a03c048c0bc425.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235746/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in milk and vanilla until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/07Ob3nu86SpEtfVAxaXvoxUbE18=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235746-Peanut-Butter-Cake-ddmfs-step-08-4x3_8708-32b4211109ec49af8d95cfa06d2df6c9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235746/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk in confectioners' sugar until icing is smooth, 3 to 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/x3IXUzz0KuiGN3TWnWlI2DB2AuA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235746-Peanut-Butter-Cake-ddmfs-step-09.1-4x3_8714-c6d0535571fe4190b2ca0f3d6403c69e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235746/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour icing over warm cake and spread evenly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2WTgnu7TlxmCvwci4HGDBGZAcWk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235746-Peanut-Butter-Cake-ddmfs-4x3_8741-ae067d3f46d94ddd9e5aca266575305b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235746/step_11.webp"
